# Optically-thick IONMIX-style multigroup-opacity fixture for the [17a]/#24
# multigroup FLD verification.  Lines beginning with '#' are comments (skipped).
# All numeric tokens are whitespace-delimited and consumed in order.
#
# Layout:
#   ntemp ndens ngroups
#   temps[ntemp]             (eV, log-spaced ascending)
#   densities[ndens]         (g/cc, log-spaced ascending)
#   group_bounds[ngroups+1]  (eV, ascending photon-energy boundaries)
#   planck_absorb[it][id][ig]  (cm^2/g, group index fastest)
#   planck_emiss [it][id][ig]
#   rosseland    [it][id][ig]
#
# Synthetic positive power-law opacities (exact under log-log interpolation), with
# reference (rho0,T0) = (1e-2 g/cc, 1e2 eV):
#   rosseland    (ig,rho,T) = A[ig]*(rho/rho0)^0.6*(T/T0)^-2.0, A=[3e5,1.5e5,1e5]
#   planck_absorb(ig,rho,T) = 20*(ig+1)*(rho/rho0)^0.5*(T/T0)^-1.5
#   planck_emiss (ig,rho,T) = 30*(ig+1)*(rho/rho0)^0.4*(T/T0)^-1.0
# At the background (rho0,T0) the Rosseland *extinction* chi_g = rho0*kappa_R,g is
# {3000, 1500, 1000} 1/length -> grey-limit D_g = c/(3 chi_g) spans a factor of 3.
# header: ntemp ndens ngroups
         5         4         3
# temperature nodes [eV]
1.0000000000000000e+00 1.0000000000000000e+01 1.0000000000000000e+02 1.0000000000000000e+03 1.0000000000000000e+04
# density nodes [g/cc]
1.0000000000000000e-03 1.0000000000000000e-02 1.0000000000000001e-01 1.0000000000000000e+00
# group energy boundaries [eV] (ngroups+1)
1.0000000000000000e+00 1.0000000000000000e+01 1.0000000000000000e+02 1.0000000000000000e+03
